OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 sailor and SBS member dies
OL,4,Aaged 101
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the West of England's last
OL,7,Fsurviving veterans from World War Two
OL,8,Fhas passed away aged 101.
OL,10,FHarry Francis, from South
OL,11,FGloucestershire, joined the Royal Navy
OL,12,Fin 1942 at 16, having lied about his
OL,13,Fage to serve.
OL,15,FHe went on to join the Royal Marines
OL,16,Fand became one of the first men to join
OL,17,Fthe Special Boat Service (SBS),
OL,18,Fcarrying out covert operations in
OL,19,FItaly, Lebanon and Burma, where he was
OL,20,Fwounded.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
