OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 sailor and SBS member dies
OL,4,Aaged 101
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Gloucestershire Armed Forces Day
OL,7,Fput out a tribute on social media where
OL,8,Forganisers said: "His quiet bravery and
OL,9,Fhis remarkable life will not be
OL,10,Fforgotten."
